    old "I can't even fight back like this... I wouldn't. I'm whatever you say I am."
    new "Eu nem consigo reagir assim... e nem reagiria. Eu sou o que você disser que eu sou."

    # game/scripts/Actions/tease.rpy:245
    old "Held like this... okay. Yes. Say it again if you want. I'll take it."
    new "Presa assim... tá bom. Sim. Fala de novo, se quiser. Eu aguento."

